    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but what about smaller stuff like software subscriptions or even some of the random supplies i buy? sometimes it feels like those little costs just bleed away and i lose track of where the money actually went. is there a certain threshold for what i should be tracking vs just letting it be?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
